# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
node_modules_old
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# bun.lock has been deliberately removed from this repo twice before (see
# commits 3798262, 001e891) -- its presence at the root makes Vercel/EAS Build
# auto-detect bun as the package manager, which breaks both (root package.json
# has no "build" script, and EAS's frozen-lockfile install fails on drift).
# This repo standardizes on package-lock.json/yarn.lock at the root instead.
bun.lock
bun.lockb
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
